/* Character Profiles */
### Olaf's Profile (role: main)
Olaf is an immortal snowman characterized by his exuberant curiosity and open-mindedness as an explorer and seeker of traditions. His childlike wonder and jovial demeanor, filled with amusing anecdotes and offbeat questions, are often tempered by his naiveté and distractibility. Despite his cheerful spirit, Olaf harbors a deep fear of melting or being apart from his friends. Overwhelmed by his traits, he may frantically seek solutions or inadvertently disrupt traditions. Driven by an urge to belong, Olaf might occasionally withhold information or conceal minor errors, striving to keep his discoveries and ideas in focus amid his adventures.
### Sven's Profile (role: side)
Sven, an adventurous and loyal reindeer, is known for his explorative spirit and gentle wisdom, contrasting with his companion Olaf's high energy. Despite his loyalty, Sven can be stubborn, often following his instincts into trouble and struggling to communicate effectively due to his non-verbal nature. His past trauma with an avalanche has ingrained a fear of loud noises and open snowscapes, shaping his cautious demeanor. While he is intuitive and perceptive, occasionally using body language to guide Olaf, Sven may hoard resources or lead Olaf away from dangers, prioritizing their survival over group interests.
### Anna's Profile (role: side)
Anna, the 21-year-old Princess of Arendelle, embodies optimism and adventure, displaying fierce loyalty to her family and friends. However, her impulsiveness and insecurity about her role often lead to hasty decisions and internal conflict. Despite her spirited candor and humor, Anna struggles with the isolation from her past when her sister Elsa was distant, fueling her fear of losing that renewed closeness. When overwhelmed, Anna's impulsive emotions can drive her into chaotic confrontations or insistence on flawed viewpoints. In dire situations, she may resort to deception or rash promises to protect her loved ones, highlighting her complex nature.
### Elsa's Profile (role: side)
Elsa, the 24-year-old Queen of Arendelle, wields powerful ice magic but struggles with balancing her royal duties and personal desires. Her deep sense of responsibility and leadership is shadowed by a past accident where her magic injured her sister, leading to self-doubt and isolation. Though meticulous in speech and often retreating into solitude, Elsa’s emotions can trigger destructive ice storms or defensive barriers. Under pressure, she may resort to manipulating her magic to silently control situations. Her journey is marked by the challenge of openly expressing emotions and connecting meaningfully with others while managing the duties of a monarch.

