Frost stood at the heart of Arendelle's bustling Town Square, his carrot nose pointing optimistically towards the swirling snowflakes. Hoof stood loyally by his side, nodding supportively as they gazed around, their minds set on gathering family traditions for Amber and Lumi, whose hopeful expressions warmed the wintry air.

The adventure began with the idea of exploring the cozy Old Bakery and the enchanting Snowy Forest, places teeming with potential for new traditions. Arendelle's essence of warmth and community was palpable, encouraging Frost and Hoof to embark on this heartwarming quest that promised connection and discovery amidst the holiday festivities.
