Lumi is a 20-year-old baker known for her deeply empathetic nature and protective instincts, particularly towards her younger sister, Amber. Shaped by the traumatic loss of their parents during a winter storm in her youth, Lumi is driven by a fear of loss, making her overly cautious and prone to anxiety. While her intuition and nurturing demeanor create comforting environments, her hesitance towards spontaneity and difficulty expressing personal needs often leave her feeling unsupported. In times of extreme stress, her protective instincts can lead to controlling behavior, and her desire to shield Amber may compel her to withhold truths or prioritize family over others.
